  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商業軟體應用",
    "sub_ename": "APPLIED BUSINESS SOFTWARES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在教導學生如何使用套裝軟體EXCEL製作各種試算表及繪圖。並進階應用於商業統計、財務、會計等方面，並將結果輸出報表。主要授課內容包括：工作表格式的設定、圖表的編輯與繪製、公式與函數的應用、及樞紐分析表的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces Excel software models and packages , as well as advanced functions such as recording, aggregating, application to business statistics, financial, accounting, and report generation. Topics covered include setting the format of the worksheet, editing and drawing of charts, the application of formula and functions, and the analysis of the Pivot Table reports.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
